%I A366338 #15 Oct 24 2026 10:51:37
%S A366338 1,1,8,44,509,7091,119302
%N A366338 Number of free (4,2)-polyominoids with n cells, allowing right-angled (or hard) connections only.
%C A366338 Two squares sharing an edge have a right-angled connection if they do not lie in the same plane.
%C A366338 Connections that are not right-angled (flat connections) may occur, but the polyominoids considered here must be connected through right-angled connections only.
